# CVE-2025-47273 (setuptools path traversal): false positive. Trivy detects
# this from pip's own bundled site-packages/pip/_vendor/bom.cdx.json, a
# static CycloneDX SBOM describing the provenance of pip's vendored
# libraries -- not an installed package. The only setuptools actually
# installed in the image is 84.0.0 (fixed). Verified via a `find`/`grep`
# across the built image: no setuptools-70.3.0 dist-info exists anywhere.
CVE-2025-47273
